OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after chainsaws and
OL,4,Acrowbars used in break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter burglars cut through a shop's
OL,8,Fshutters in an early-morning break-in
OL,9,Fin Sutton-in-Ashfield.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said they
OL,12,Fresponded to reports of the burglary at
OL,13,FCo-op on Alfreton Road at about 03:15
OL,14,FBST on 11 September.
OL,16,FA force statement said about #2,000 was
OL,17,Fstolen "after intruders used chainsaws
OL,18,Fand crowbars to cut through the metal
OL,19,Fshutters outside the store".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
